{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And they returned to the land of the Philistines.</b> Its meaning is: and they returned to their city which is in the land of the Philistines, for they were already in the land of the Philistines. But they dwell in Gerar, which is the capital of the king, while he dwells in Beersheba, which is in the land of the Philistines, in the wadi of Gerar."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:33:06.593252839Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}